  "description": "A Windows installer for .NET products, built in WPF: a per-machine Setup.exe with a wizard, silent modes, upgrades with rollback, a version check, a Windows service, shortcuts, an \"Apps & features\" entry and its own uninstaller. The program files are embedded at build time. Command line /SILENT, /VERYSILENT, /SUPPRESSMSGBOXES, /LOG, /DIR, /TASKS with documented exit codes, for update mechanisms and IT scripts.",
